# The canonical origin. Vercel injects VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL and
# VERCEL_URL at build time and src/lib/siteUrl.ts falls back to them, but both
# name a *.vercel.app host — metadataBase, the sitemap and the Sitemap: line in
# robots.txt would then advertise an origin that is not the one users see.
# Stating it here is what makes the production domain canonical, and it is the
# only value that survives a change of hosting provider.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://jokehub.org
